          "before": "e896b20000",
          "offset": "0x193F5",
          "purpose": "route the save-slot menu's tribe delete through the reset stub, which erases this patcher's state for that slot before the game erases the save -- so a new tribe started in the same slot does not inherit the old one's masks and logs"
        }
